# Noise through a held chord (C3 E3 G3), which stays after the keys are up (latch); then a new chord (D3 F3 A3 C4)
# takes over while the old strings ring out, and a fifth note steals the oldest string.
tempo 120
steps 48
tail 1
track fx1
input noise 0.3
param p1 170
param p2 120
param pan 255
param level 255
gain 1
note 4 C3 8
note 4 E3 8
note 4 G3 8
note 24 D3 4
note 24 F3 4
note 24 A3 4
note 24 C4 4
note 26 E4 2
expect sound 1 48
expect peak_below 0
